            <note corresp="#d19-f1" n="49" xml:id="d19-f1-content">
                <p>For the record of the 14th meeting of the Council of Foreign Ministers at London,
                    September 20, 1945, see <ref target="frus1945v02#pg_275"><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Foreign Relations</hi>, 1945, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>,
                        p. 275</ref>.</p>
            </note>
